# A PlayStation game: Disc Test (brick/sim/make-ps1.py) runs under PCSX ReARMed and fills
# the screen, ejects back to the shelf, and HOME → Screen has a PlayStation page. Two Disc Test
# fans its discs out on A; the second one, picked, is the one that boots.
press a
phase Shelf
press l1       # the PlayStation shelf, last in the ring
press a
phase Playing 30000
wait 2000
snap playing
hold menu 1500 # save state, eject, back to the shelf
phase Shelf 20000
press menu
phase QuickMenu
press a        # Screen
press up       # PlayStation, last on the page
press a
snap menu-screen-ps1
press b
press b
press b
phase Shelf
press right    # Two Disc Test
idle
press a
snap fan
press right
snap fan-disc-2
press a
phase Playing 30000
wait 2000
snap playing-disc-2
